(Description: This is a Tantra revealed through a certain Kulālaṛṣi the Potter ṛṣi. It contains a series of procedures -vidhi- commonly required in the course of ritual such as the establishment of the sacrificial jar and other sacred objects -pratiṣṭhā-, purificatory rites -śaucya- and the like. The main deity is śāstṛ, that is, Skanda.)


